### VigiDoor Stream Control Service - API Tests
### 使用 VS Code REST Client 插件运行 (humao.rest-client)
## 192.168.38.166
@baseUrl = http://192.168.38.166:5002
@deviceId = VIGIDOOR_7c3a41081017190d_RPI
@appName = live


# ============================================================
# 一、健康检查
# ============================================================

### 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json


# ============================================================
# 二、配置检查
# ============================================================

### 检查 IoTDA 配置是否有效
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/config/check
Accept: application/json


# ============================================================
# 三、手动推流控制（REST API）
# ============================================================

### 开始推流（使用默认 RTMP URL 模板）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stream/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "device_id": "{{deviceId}}"
}

###

### 开始推流（自定义 RTMP URL）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stream/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "device_id": "{{deviceId}}",
    "rtmp_url": "rtmp://zlm-server:1935/live/{{deviceId}}",
    "params": {
        "resolution": "1280x720",
        "fps": 25
    }
}

###

### 停止推流
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stream/stop
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "device_id": "{{deviceId}}"
}


# ============================================================
# 四、ZLMediaKit Webhook 模拟测试
# ============================================================

### [ZLM Webhook] on_stream_not_found
### 模拟：有拉流请求但流不存在 → 应触发设备开始推流
POST {{baseUrl}}/index/hook/on_stream_not_found
Content-Type: application/json
Tools: ZLMediaKit
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; Intel Mac OS X 10_12_1) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/57.0.2987.133 Safari/537.36

{
    "mediaServerId": "your_server_id",
    "app": "{{appName}}",
    "id": "140183261486112",
    "ip": "10.0.17.132",
    "params": "",
    "port": 49614,
    "schema": "rtsp",
    "stream": "{{deviceId}}",
    "vhost": "__defaultVhost__"
}

###

### [ZLM Webhook] on_stream_not_found（RTMP 协议）
POST {{baseUrl}}/index/hook/on_stream_not_found
Content-Type: application/json
Tools: ZLMediaKit

{
    "mediaServerId": "your_server_id",
    "app": "{{appName}}",
    "id": "140183261486113",
    "ip": "192.168.1.100",
    "params": "",
    "port": 49615,
    "schema": "rtmp",
    "stream": "{{deviceId}}",
    "vhost": "__defaultVhost__"
}

###

### [ZLM Webhook] on_stream_none_reader
### 模拟：流无人观看 → 应触发设备停止推流，ZLM 关闭该路流
POST {{baseUrl}}/index/hook/on_stream_none_reader
Content-Type: application/json
Tools: ZLMediaKit
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; Intel Mac OS X 10_12_1) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/57.0.2987.133 Safari/537.36

{
    "mediaServerId": "your_server_id",
    "app": "{{appName}}",
    "schema": "rtmp",
    "stream": "{{deviceId}}",
    "vhost": "__defaultVhost__"
}

###

### [ZLM Webhook] on_stream_none_reader（RTSP 协议）
POST {{baseUrl}}/index/hook/on_stream_none_reader
Content-Type: application/json
Tools: ZLMediaKit

{
    "mediaServerId": "your_server_id",
    "app": "{{appName}}",
    "schema": "rtsp",
    "stream": "{{deviceId}}",
    "vhost": "__defaultVhost__"
}


# ============================================================
# 五、异常场景测试
# ============================================================

### 开始推流 - 缺少 device_id（期望 400）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stream/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "rtmp_url": "rtmp://zlm-server:1935/live/test"
}

###

### 停止推流 - 缺少 device_id（期望 400）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stream/stop
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### [ZLM Webhook] on_stream_not_found - 空 stream 字段（期望正常返回 200，但跳过命令下发）
POST {{baseUrl}}/index/hook/on_stream_not_found
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "mediaServerId": "your_server_id",
    "app": "live",
    "stream": "",
    "schema": "rtsp",
    "vhost": "__defaultVhost__"
}
